{"module":"grammar","item":{"id":"b1-grammar-infinitiv-zu","level":"B1","topic":"Infinitivsätze","title":{"de":"zu + Infinitiv","bn":"zu + Infinitiv"},"summary":"কিছু verb-এর পরে zu-সহ infinitive: Ich hoffe, … zu finden.","sections":[{"heading":"zu + Infinitiv","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":"কিছু verb ও expression-এর পরে zu-সহ infinitive লাগে।"},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Ich hoffe, bald eine Arbeit zu finden.","en":"I hope to find a job soon.","bn":"আমি আশা করি শিগগিরই একটি কাজ খুঁজে পাব।"}]}]},{"heading":"Separable verb-এ zu মাঝখানে","blocks":[{"kind":"text","text":"Common mistake: zu সবসময় infinitive-এর ঠিক আগে বসে না। Separable verb হলে মাঝখানে আসে:"},{"kind":"list","items":["einkaufen → einzukaufen","aufstehen → aufzustehen"]},{"kind":"examples","items":[{"de":"Ich habe keine Zeit, heute einzukaufen.","en":"I have no time to go shopping today.","bn":"আজ বাজার করার সময় আমার নেই।"}]}]}],"part":4,"test":[{"id":"b1-grammar-infinitiv-zu-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich hoffe, bald eine Arbeit ___ finden.","options":["zu","um","für"],"answer":0,"explanation":"hoffen-এর পরে zu + infinitive।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-infinitiv-zu-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"einkaufen → zu-সহ রূপ কোনটি?","options":["zu einkaufen","einzukaufen","einkaufenzu"],"answer":1,"explanation":"separable verb-এ zu মাঝখানে: einzukaufen।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-infinitiv-zu-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"aufstehen → zu-সহ রূপ কোনটি?","options":["aufzustehen","zu aufstehen","aufstehenzu"],"answer":0,"explanation":"auf + zu + stehen।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-infinitiv-zu-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich habe keine Zeit, heute ___.","options":["zu einkaufen","einkaufen zu","einzukaufen"],"answer":2,"explanation":"separable verb: einzukaufen।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-infinitiv-zu-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Ich hoffe, bald eine Arbeit zu finden.“ মানে কী?","options":["আমি শিগগিরই একটি কাজ খুঁজে পেয়েছি।","আমি আশা করি শিগগিরই একটি কাজ খুঁজে পাব।","আমি কাজ খুঁজতে চাই না।"],"answer":1,"explanation":"hoffen + zu + infinitive।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-infinitiv-zu-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"Es ist schwer, früh ___. (aufstehen)","options":["aufzustehen","zu aufstehen","aufstehen"],"answer":0,"explanation":"zu মাঝখানে: aufzustehen।"}]},"schema":1,"id":"b1-grammar-infinitiv-zu","level":"B1","test":[{"id":"b1-grammar-infinitiv-zu-t1","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich hoffe, bald eine Arbeit ___ finden.","options":["zu","um","für"],"answer":0,"explanation":"hoffen-এর পরে zu + infinitive।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-infinitiv-zu-t2","type":"mcq","prompt":"einkaufen → zu-সহ রূপ কোনটি?","options":["zu einkaufen","einzukaufen","einkaufenzu"],"answer":1,"explanation":"separable verb-এ zu মাঝখানে: einzukaufen।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-infinitiv-zu-t3","type":"mcq","prompt":"aufstehen → zu-সহ রূপ কোনটি?","options":["aufzustehen","zu aufstehen","aufstehenzu"],"answer":0,"explanation":"auf + zu + stehen।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-infinitiv-zu-t4","type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich habe keine Zeit, heute ___.","options":["zu einkaufen","einkaufen zu","einzukaufen"],"answer":2,"explanation":"separable verb: einzukaufen।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-infinitiv-zu-t5","type":"mcq","prompt":"„Ich hoffe, bald eine Arbeit zu finden.“ মানে কী?","options":["আমি শিগগিরই একটি কাজ খুঁজে পেয়েছি।","আমি আশা করি শিগগিরই একটি কাজ খুঁজে পাব।","আমি কাজ খুঁজতে চাই না।"],"answer":1,"explanation":"hoffen + zu + infinitive।"},{"id":"b1-grammar-infinitiv-zu-t6","type":"mcq","prompt":"Es ist schwer, früh ___. (aufstehen)","options":["aufzustehen","zu aufstehen","aufstehen"],"answer":0,"explanation":"zu মাঝখানে: aufzustehen।"}]}